OL,3,GNEWSANature reserve safeguards rare
OL,4,Abird population
OL,5,
OL,6,FA farm that was turned into a nature
OL,7,Freserve 20 years ago has become a 'safe
OL,8,Fhaven' for a rare bird, according to a
OL,9,Fconservation charity.
OL,11,FWinterbourne Downs nature reserve, near
OL,12,FSalisbury in Wiltshire, was created by
OL,13,Fthe RSPB in 2006 to safeguard the
OL,14,FStone-curlew bird and to protect the
OL,15,Flink between two of the country's
OL,16,Flargest areas of chalk grassland, the
OL,17,FSalisbury Plain and Porton Down.
OL,19,FMore than 100 Stone-curlews have
OL,20,Fsuccessfully fledged since 2006.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
